  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [autoprefixer](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer) from `v7.1.6` to `v7.2.1`\n\n\n### Commits\n\n<details>\n<summary>postcss/autoprefixer</summary>\n\n#### 7.2.1\n-   [`0864685`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/0864685dc120a638c086b3574164cb56cd6e544d) Release 7.2.1 version\n-   [`b8cbd67`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/b8cbd673b81360214c3bb4d597b83639aca0027f) Fix old JS runtimes support\n#### 7.2.0\n-   [`842b392`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/842b392c8e1fb73cffedbc7bc2c20c7a40c9608c) Release 7.2 version\n-   [`c3ef200`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/c3ef200fcac6ef12e375790e938adfd9834e1eea) Fix grid-template-areas warning\n-   [`151f84f`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/151f84f995c0559d86fabd0019c90886ae18b936) Clean up code\n-   [`08a0db0`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/08a0db01867a04cd6f17002d08cb3d3343b3bbab) Add grid-template-areas support (#&#8203;948)\n-   [`f460f38`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/f460f382dfa9ae0488324f5c73f515abd91c88f8) Fix Jest warning\n-   [`8eb8403`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/8eb84035c948037127bdd926844a35f4d4ce9fd4) Update dependencies\n-   [`79b48cf`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/79b48cfc27ea347d382a2cc7c5b2cb570ef4ee4f) Add missing semicolons (#&#8203;946)\n-   [`7d22d1f`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/7d22d1fdc7e511e5675b6787670cc399b1dca7a5) Update Size Limit\n-   [`01c5385`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/01c5385b17bdd4e1f53c9b1a20adb6da9efdbe20) Copy bin scripts to build directory\n-   [`1cb2b6b`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/1cb2b6bbddfe0987bc42d0453f078e74d54bb795) Add autoprefixer-info CLI tool\n-   [`83de1e8`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/83de1e82c0d418aac4a5fa0faebf71a354babdc3) Remove unsupported Grid warning\n-   [`d5801a6`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/d5801a634f0ebf47c7236b3013ee922a004e14a0) Improve test coverage\n-   [`eb11f02`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/eb11f027a50c25140e2d1ac84da164b6c97b27e5) Add warnings for old radial syntax\n-   [`0d33752`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/0d337529b530670ffd509d425dc0129e488ccf69) Use ESLint CI instead of ESLint\n-   [`36f44e8`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/36f44e8ed604d0ecaf7c467a379ad2882624d0fd) Update dependencies\n-   [`7c5ec6d`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/7c5ec6d9f9d7382b26783b09545de669e15713ff) Clean up grid hacks\n-   [`ac2eb81`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/ac2eb81dcd3ac994b543084b9ef7924a54816ba1) Merge branch &#x27;master&#x27; into master\n-   [`903102e`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/903102ec90fd01d343f3f94f035e9b69bdd8ad9a) Add support for grid-template shorthand\n-   [`84f1f0f`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/84f1f0fbd346d38f8718134368449346c0d2d52b) Add code coverage, tests of initializing and remove not used code (#&#8203;928)\n-   [`1f3bae6`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/1f3bae669d2576ace23fe0c4a9443f23ccf0e9d7) Update dependencies\n-   [`713a019`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/713a01946018867f703b82b37386af5d500f1a23) Clean up code\n-   [`1d3ef1c`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/1d3ef1c969ab7cfad31e50f9de83d14ba4c5c29b) Add partial grid-area support, improve grid-row and grid-column support (#&#8203;938)\n-   [`9a523b5`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/9a523b5631edcffe995f785af41ca6a5dde84e77) Do not prefix modern animation-direction values\n-   [`178547b`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/178547b4cb61b3fbd0c9ea0e726bcce6687321de) Clean up code\n-   [`4effadc`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/4effadcc0d25989336eac52c67126351343d9504) Update dependencies\n-   [`aa55b76`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/aa55b76e6f76f4df8b9c3c76c470eddda93f1832) Add Node.js 8 to Travis CI\n-   [`5857d6a`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/5857d6a05f729580c558c510f85862b198e2f6f8) Provide a default file path for info() output (#&#8203;932)\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
